# The build context for backend/Dockerfile is the repository root (docker-compose.yml), so
# everything not listed here is sent to the Docker daemon on every build. Only pyproject.toml,
# backend/ and eval/ are COPYed into the image. Keep eval/data (compose pins
# eval/data/fixtures/fixture_document.json for the seed) and the eval/reports directory itself
# (the harness writes into it); drop only the per-run reports.
.venv
.git
.devdb
storage
.env
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
eval/reports/*.md
eval/reports/*.json
frontend
